OL,3,GNEWSABody 'kept in van for two weeks'
OL,4,Abefore being moved to lough
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was beaten to death and her
OL,7,Fbody kept in a van for two weeks before
OL,8,Fit was placed in Lough Erne, a court
OL,9,Fheard on Thursday.
OL,11,FThe detail emerged as a nephew of the
OL,12,Fman charged with the murder of Carrie
OL,13,FMullane appeared in court in connection
OL,14,Fto her death.
OL,16,FThe 39-year-old from Limerick went
OL,17,Fmissing in Enniskillen, County
OL,18,FFermanagh, on 10 October. A body was
OL,19,Frecovered from the lough on 9 November
OL,20,Fand a formal identification process is
OL,21,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
