OL,3,GNEWSABody 'kept in van for two weeks'
OL,4,Abefore being moved to lough
OL,5,
OL,6,FKenneth Lynch, 31, from Trasna Park in
OL,7,FEnniskillen, appeared at Strabane
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court via videolink
OL,9,Fcharged with withholding information
OL,10,Fand encouraging or assisting in the
OL,11,Fcommission of an offence, namely
OL,12,Fmurder.
